Package: lunduke-linux-kernel
Version: 7.2.6-lcos11
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: 28
Maintainer: LCOS <lcos@lunduke.com>
Homepage: https://lunduke.com
Depends: linux-image-7.2.6-lunduke (= 7.2.6-lcos11)
Recommends: linux-headers-7.2.6-lunduke (= 7.2.6-lcos11)
Description: Lunduke's Linux Kernel for LCOS
 Lunduke's Linux Kernel — LCOS kernel package (ABI lcos11).
 .
 Installs linux-image-7.2.6-lunduke. Headers are recommended for
 building out-of-tree modules.
 .
 lcos11 adds 12 HW gaps on lcos10: USB4/Type-C, VMXNET3/VMCI,
 Hyper-V guest, USB UAS, laptop WMI (ThinkPad/IdeaPad/ASUS/Dell/HP),
 Apple/Lenovo/Microsoft HID, virtio balloon/mmio/fs, TPM, BRCMSMAC,
 MWIFIEX. Rust left off (No Forced Rust).
 .
 Default kernel on LCOS 0.8 ISOs (Devuan 6.x kernel removed from those
 images). On earlier LCOS releases that still ship a Distro kernel,
 installing this metapackage adds a GRUB entry alongside it.
